{"sha": "c6b3d67a79621c43051802802ac57900cfcf9a189073a0825e948e66da6e319f", "body": ["\\begin{example}[耦合数列]\\label{ex:g12:matrix:coupled}", "设 $u_{n+1} = 3u_n + v_n$，$v_{n+1} = u_n + 3v_n$。令", "$X_n = \\begin{pmatrix} u_n\\\\ v_n \\end{pmatrix}$ 及", "$A = \\begin{pmatrix} 3 & 1\\\\ 1 & 3\\end{pmatrix}$，则", "$X_{n+1} = AX_n$，故 $X_n = A^n X_0$。辅助数列", "$s_n = u_n + v_n$ 与 $d_n = u_n - v_n$ 满足 $s_{n+1} = 4s_n$ 及", "$d_{n+1} = 2d_n$，故 $s_n = 4^n s_0$，$d_n = 2^n d_0$，且", "\\[", "u_n = \\frac{4^n(u_0+v_0) + 2^n(u_0-v_0)}{2}, \\qquad", "v_n = \\frac{4^n(u_0+v_0) - 2^n(u_0-v_0)}{2}.", "\\]", "（背后的思路：$(1,1)$ 与 $(1,-1)$ 是 $A$ 的特征向量方向。）", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{图与游走}", "", "\\begin{definition}[图、邻接矩阵]\\label{def:g12:matrix:graph}", "一个\\emph{图}\\index{图}由顶点 $1, 2, \\dots, n$ 及", "连接某些顶点对的边组成（对于\\emph{有向}", "图，边为有序对）。其\\emph{邻接矩阵}\\index{邻接矩阵}是", "$n \\times n$ 矩阵 $M$，其中 $m_{ij} = 1$ 当有边从 $i$ 到", "$j$，否则为 $0$。长度为 $k$ 的从 $i$ 到 $j$ 的\\emph{游走}", "是由 $k$ 条相继边组成的、从 $i$ 到 $j$ 的序列。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[baseline=(current bounding box.center)]", "  \\node[circle, draw, inner sep=2.5pt] (v1) at (0,0) {$1$};", "  \\node[circle, draw, inner sep=2.5pt] (v2) at (2.6,1.2) {$2$};", "  \\node[circle, draw, inner sep=2.5pt] (v3) at (2.6,-1.2) {$3$};", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omDef, thick] (v1) -- (v2);", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omDef, thick] (v2) -- (v3);", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omDef, thick] (v1) to[bend right=18] (v3);", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omDef, thick] (v3) to[bend right=18] (v1);", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "\\qquad\\qquad", "$M = \\begin{pmatrix} 0 & 1 & 1\\\\ 0 & 0 & 1\\\\ 1 & 0 & 0 \\end{pmatrix}$", "", "{\\small 有向图及其邻接矩阵", "（见\\cref{exo:g12:matrix:6}）：$m_{ij} = 1$ 当且仅当存在从 $i$ 到", "$j$ 的边。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{theorem}[游走计数]\\label{thm:g12:matrix:walks}", "长度为 $k$、从顶点 $i$ 到顶点 $j$ 的游走数，", "为 $(i,j)$ 位置上的元素，该矩阵为 $M^k$。", "\\end{theorem}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "对 $k$ 作归纳。当 $k = 1$ 时，即为 $M$ 的定义。假设", "对 $k$ 的结论成立。长度为 $k+1$ 的从 $i$ 到 $j$ 的游走，是由长度为 $k$ 的、从 $i$ 到某顶点 $l$ 的游走", "后接一条从 $l$ 到 $j$ 的边组成，由", "加法原理与乘法原理，其数目为", "\\[", "\\sum_{l=1}^{n} \\bigl(M^k\\bigr)_{il}\\, m_{lj} = \\bigl(M^{k+1}\\bigr)_{ij}.", "\\qedhere", "\\]", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{example}", "对三角形图（$3$ 个顶点，每两个顶点都相连），", "$M = \\begin{pmatrix} 0&1&1\\\\ 1&0&1\\\\ 1&1&0\\end{pmatrix}$ 及", "$M^2 = \\begin{pmatrix} 2&1&1\\\\ 1&2&1\\\\ 1&1&2\\end{pmatrix}$：从每个顶点出发，", "回到自身的长度为 $2$ 的游走有 $2$ 条（经由任一邻点），", "到其余每个顶点的游走各有 $1$ 条。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{练习}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g12:matrix:1}", "设 $A = \\begin{pmatrix} 1 & 2\\\\ 0 & 1 \\end{pmatrix}$，", "$B = \\begin{pmatrix} 2 & 0\\\\ 1 & 1 \\end{pmatrix}$。计算 $A + B$，$AB$，", "$BA$ 及 $A^2$。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g12:matrix:2}", "判断下列矩阵是否可逆，并求出", "可逆时的逆矩阵：", "\\[", "A = \\begin{pmatrix} 2 & 5\\\\ 1 & 3\\end{pmatrix}, \\qquad", "B = \\begin{pmatrix} 3 & 6\\\\ 2 & 4\\end{pmatrix}.", "\\]", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g12:matrix:3}", "用矩阵求逆法解方程组：", "$\\begin{cases} 2x + 5y = 1\\\\ x + 3y = 2 . \\end{cases}$", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:g12:matrix:4}", "设 $A = \\begin{pmatrix} 2 & 1\\\\ 0 & 2\\end{pmatrix} = 2I + N$，其中", "$N = \\begin{pmatrix} 0 & 1\\\\ 0 & 0 \\end{pmatrix}$.", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 验证 $N^2 = 0$，且 $I$ 与 $N$ 可交换。", "  \\item 由此求出 $A^k$（对所有 $k \\in \\N$），并", "        用直接计算验证 $k=2$ 时的公式。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:g12:matrix:5}", "设 $A = \\begin{pmatrix} 0 & 1\\\\ 1 & 1\\end{pmatrix}$，记 $F_n$ 为斐波那契", "数列（$F_0 = 0$，$F_1 = 1$，$F_{n+2} = F_{n+1} + F_n$）。用归纳法证明：", "对 $n \\geq 1$，", "\\[", "A^n = \\begin{pmatrix} F_{n-1} & F_n\\\\ F_n & F_{n+1}\\end{pmatrix},", "\\]", "并由此推出恒等式 $F_{n+1}F_{n-1} - F_n^2 = (-1)^n$。", "（提示：行列式满足乘法法则 $\\det(MN) = \\det M \\det N$，你可以", "对 $2\\times2$ 矩阵加以验证。）", "\\end{exercise}", ""]}